  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\u27e8\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}-2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, let $u=3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t$, so $\\text{d}u={csc}^{2}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t}\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int -2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\\,\\text{d}t=2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\u27e8\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061t}{3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061t){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3)-\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(2),\\,2\\,(0-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8ln\\,(\\frac{3}{2}),\\,-\\sqrt{2}\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
